== (b) the reviewed head's rule body only: fib daddr type local counter reject
  S -> container 172.31.0.2:8080 (routed via br0h, unpublished)   REACHED hello
  S -> published 172.31.0.1:9090 (host-local, DNAT to the container) REACHED hello
  S -> host-local 172.31.0.1:8082 (bridge gateway listener)       REFUSED TimeoutError
